Key Vault,

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.600
Identidades e Rede.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.660
Uma definição de ambiente

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.260
por estágio,

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:19.660
Dev,

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:20.080
Test,

